SF0014 Wyoming imagination library program.
Sponsored By: Joint Education Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to education; establishing the Wyoming imagination library
program; providing funding for the free distribution of books to young children
as specified; providing definitions; creating an account; requiring rulemaking;
providing an appropriation; and providing for an effective date.
